5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Hello everyone. Since our household has grown, it is only logical that our payment structure evolves too. To ensure we are fair to all, I suggest we start by examining the data.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree, Benjamin! Let's make this super fair for everyone. I'm excited to figure this out together! What kind of data should we start with?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that fairness is key. To avoid any misunderstandings or lingering frustrations, I think we should look at the actual usage and the history of our payments.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It would be prudent to understand our historical spending and any potential costs associated with changing our current system before we commit to a new arrangement.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I think it's a good idea to look at things together. I want us all to be happy. Maybe we can see how we've been paying and if anyone felt sad about it?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we are in agreement, let's be specific. I believe the payment log for the last twelve months and the plug-in monitor readings room by room would provide the most objective foundation for our discussion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Those sound like great ideas, Benjamin! I'm curious about how other houses do it, so I'd like to see the monthly settle observed at another house and a trial run of a reconciliation template!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be helpful to see the last twelve utility statements and the payment log for the last twelve months. This will help us see if the current burden is truly uneven.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I would like to look into the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms. I believe these will clarify our annual spending patterns and any immediate costs for adjustments.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I want to know more about how we've been doing. I'll choose the payment log for the last twelve months and the settling up when the last rooms filled. I hope we can all be friends.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a healthy variety of interests. I am content with my choices, as they prioritize empirical data over anecdote. Shall we proceed to the investigation phase?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Yes, let's do it! I can't wait to see if that template makes things easier for us. Let's go find out!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am also ready. I believe having a clear picture of the past twelve months will bring us the peace and clarity we need to move forward.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am also ready. Once we have the facts regarding the annual costs and the potential installation fees, we can make a decision that is sustainable for everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm ready too. I hope that by looking at the logs, we can understand each other better and make sure everyone feels okay. Let's see what we find!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Let us hope the data speaks clearly, saving us from any tedious misunderstandings. I look forward to hearing what each of you discovers.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'm sure we'll find a way that makes everyone happy and keeps things simple. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us move forward quietly and thoughtfully. I look forward to seeing how the facts align with our current situation.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us proceed with the investigation. I look forward to seeing how the data informs our next steps.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
