27,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll be waiting for everyone. I hope the things we find help us be kinder to each other.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
